00:02:17.939 --> 00:02:20.800
You're getting bolder by the day.

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.440
You actually drove into someone
in broad daylight?

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.181
Don't you know?

00:02:26.181 --> 00:02:28.520
Society runs on laws now.

00:02:29.399 --> 00:02:34.199
Stash those shady old tricks and keep them out of sight.

00:02:34.199 --> 00:02:37.279
- Understood.
- Speak Hua's language with me!

00:02:37.279 --> 00:02:39.399
Yes, Mr. Xu.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:51.320
Uncle Xu.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:57.400
If I mess up again, chew me out to my face.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.639
Xiao.

00:03:01.639 --> 00:03:04.320
Your father left you in my care,

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:07.100
so I'm responsible for you.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.440
We're a huge family business.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:11.479
We can't sit still.

00:03:11.479 --> 00:03:14.919
We finally chose to push for new growth

00:03:14.919 --> 00:03:18.739
and put you in charge of
this major move into Hua Country's pharma.

00:03:18.739 --> 00:03:21.479
You can't drop the ball.

00:03:21.479 --> 00:03:23.509
We're businessmen.

00:03:23.509 --> 00:03:25.119
Making money comes first.

00:03:25.119 --> 00:03:26.873
You're right.

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:29.479
Peace brings profit.

00:03:29.479 --> 00:03:30.880
But Uncle Xu...

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:34.600
Teach me such lessons face-to-face.

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:37.520
Don't beat around the bush
and lecture my guys.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:41.520
They won't really get it, will they?

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:45.679
Xiao, it's good that you know
where I'm coming from.

00:03:45.679 --> 00:03:49.479
It's late; I'll get going.

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:53.020
Uncle Xu. I'll walk you out.

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.399
No need.

00:03:54.399 --> 00:03:56.792
Turn in early.

00:04:05.203 --> 00:04:08.929
Boss. I'll find who tipped Mr. Xu off.

00:04:08.929 --> 00:04:12.119
Also, that Tesla driver was quick.

00:04:12.119 --> 00:04:13.440
He managed to dodge.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:15.279
He probably only got an arm injury.

00:04:15.279 --> 00:04:18.720
- Do you want us to...
- If luck's on his side, that's his karma.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:20.040
Leave it.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:23.799
What about his daughter, Xu Ting?

00:04:23.799 --> 00:04:26.600
She's flying home to recuperate.

00:04:27.559 --> 00:04:29.541
I don't want her recovering too fast.

00:04:29.541 --> 00:04:33.075
Boss, Miss Xu is the fiancée
the big boss picked for you.

00:04:33.075 --> 00:04:34.675
If he presses you about it...

00:04:34.675 --> 00:04:37.575
As long as our Hua Country
expansion goes smoothly...

00:04:41.139 --> 00:04:44.063
she no longer has to be my fiancée.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:50.818
[Episode 1]

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:56.136
Miss Xu, time for your meds.

00:04:57.879 --> 00:05:00.339
Ting Ting, just focus on getting better.

00:05:00.339 --> 00:05:03.139
If you need anything in Bangkok,
just let me know.

00:05:03.139 --> 00:05:05.240
Thanks, Xiao.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.960
Nurse, say that again. I'm old.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.420
I can't remember if you talk too fast.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:14.160
The hospital issued
a critical-condition notice.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:17.860
Doctor, what do I do? Can I still be treated?

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:19.980
We need to observe further.

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.919
Please, I'm counting on you.

00:05:21.919 --> 00:05:23.899
We'll do our best.

00:05:23.899 --> 00:05:25.820
Don't be scared, sweetie.

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.899
It'll be okay soon.

00:05:27.899 --> 00:05:30.860
No more pain, no more pain.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.179
I've told you several times...

00:05:32.179 --> 00:05:35.100
Where are your kids?
Why won't they come visit you?

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.540
They're busy with work.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:40.550
Dad, what do we do... Dad...

00:05:44.179 --> 00:05:46.200
All beings suffer.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.840
All forms are empty.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.583
May the Buddha protect us.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.059
All set.

00:05:55.059 --> 00:05:57.920
The department you need
is right across from the elevators.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.859
Thank you, young man.

00:06:00.859 --> 00:06:04.340
You're handsome and so kind.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.590
Easy there, Granny. Take it slow.

00:06:15.264 --> 00:06:18.218
Great, I'll definitely miss the meeting.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:26.900
And it's a luxury car...

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:30.459
Hope the owner's reasonable.

00:06:51.311 --> 00:06:52.812
Hello.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:55.739
I'm so sorry...

00:06:55.739 --> 00:06:59.859
I was glued to the GPS and looked up too late so I rear-ended you.

00:07:06.739 --> 00:07:08.440
Are you hurt?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:09.840
I'm fine.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.479
Do you need to go to the hospital?

00:07:11.479 --> 00:07:13.480
I knocked on your window,
but you didn't respond.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.139
I was worried you were hurt.

00:07:15.139 --> 00:07:18.096
I'm fine. It just happened so fast.

00:07:18.096 --> 00:07:21.300
- I froze for a second.
- I'm so sorry.

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.759
It's entirely my fault.

00:07:22.759 --> 00:07:25.380
I'll cover all damages.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.059
The car doesn't matter. It's more important that you're safe.

00:07:28.059 --> 00:07:30.440
I already called the traffic police
and my insurance company.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:32.780
But it might take a bit of your time.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:34.239
No problem.

00:07:34.239 --> 00:07:35.859
I'm not in a rush.

00:07:35.859 --> 00:07:37.623
Okay.

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:39.280
Thanks.

00:07:42.759 --> 00:07:43.800
Sorry.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:46.660
It's still chilly out.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.240
You're under-dressed.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:50.280
My jacket's in my suitcase.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.759
I rushed to the flight and forgot to grab it.

00:07:57.579 --> 00:08:00.359
Mind throwing on my coat for now?

00:08:00.359 --> 00:08:01.959
Well...

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:04.700
Thanks, then.

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:10.093
And don't speak so politely. Sounds stiff.

00:08:11.399 --> 00:08:14.239
I'm Fan Xiao, Thai-Hua.

00:08:14.932 --> 00:08:16.592
I'm You Shu Lang.

00:08:26.719 --> 00:08:28.959
The scent of wild roses?

00:08:28.959 --> 00:08:31.060
He looks so buttoned-up,

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:34.020
but he uses wild rose perfume.

00:08:47.079 --> 00:08:50.440
Huo, come pick me up.

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:52.719
Someone drove into my car.

00:08:52.719 --> 00:08:55.599
A white Tesla.

00:08:55.599 --> 00:08:57.126
9230.

00:08:57.126 --> 00:08:58.606
Bangkok.

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:05.580
I've been delayed 38 minutes, 42 seconds.

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:08.160
And don't cause any deaths.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:09.980
Small world, Mr. You.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.840
- We meet again.
- Mr. Fan?

00:09:14.345 --> 00:09:16.406
What are the odds.

00:09:17.399 --> 00:09:20.159
Why is your arm injured?

00:09:20.159 --> 00:09:22.279
Was it from the rear-end collision?

00:09:22.279 --> 00:09:23.679
No idea what's up lately.

00:09:23.679 --> 00:09:26.579
I'd just parked and was getting out when someone clipped me.

00:09:26.579 --> 00:09:28.119
Luckily, it's minor.

00:09:28.119 --> 00:09:29.090
- Make way, please!
- Make way!

00:09:31.079 --> 00:09:32.440
- Thanks.
- Make way!

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:34.699
A fracture isn't to be trifled with.

00:09:34.699 --> 00:09:39.940
Luckily, this Hua Country hospital
has a great reputation in Thailand.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:41.339
Here for a follow-up?

00:09:41.339 --> 00:09:42.719
I needed the bandage changed.

00:09:42.719 --> 00:09:45.860
- What brings you here?
- Visiting a patient.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:48.740
The ward hallway connects to outpatients.

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:51.800
My sense of direction sucks. I somehow wandered over here.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:55.100
-
- If it's not too much trouble,

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:58.520
could you point me to the parking lot?

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:02.459
Sure. I'll tell you the route in a bit.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.939
What's going on?

00:10:06.939 --> 00:10:08.619
Let's go.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.699
Why my child?

00:10:16.699 --> 00:10:19.019
Why do all of you...

00:10:19.019 --> 00:10:20.799
So dangerous!

00:10:20.799 --> 00:10:23.810
You grow up fine, one after another...

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:26.267
Why can't he? Why?

00:10:26.267 --> 00:10:27.664
The railing's so high.

00:10:27.664 --> 00:10:29.804
How did she get over it?

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.630
- Ma'am...
- Don't come any closer!

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:38.320
We've confirmed the diagnosis, but it's not hopeless.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:40.200
Calm down.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.359
- If we provide swift treatment...
- Swift treatment?

00:10:42.359 --> 00:10:46.220
-
- With what money?

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:50.780
I don't even have enough for one surgery!

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:52.499
Step back first! It's dangerous!

00:10:52.499 --> 00:10:53.919
You're holding a child!

00:10:53.919 --> 00:10:56.973
- Calm down.
-

00:10:56.973 --> 00:11:00.599
- Let me.
- Don't do it.

00:11:00.599 --> 00:11:03.870
Don't jump! Please don't jump!

00:11:06.503 --> 00:11:08.780
Listen up! Fire rescue just said

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.780
if the adult falls, don't try to catch her.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:13.780
You'll get hurt. But we can try to catch the child.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:16.420
We can use coats and bed sheets as cushioning.

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:20.161
Before they arrive, be ready to catch the baby!

00:11:20.161 --> 00:11:21.840
Quick! Jackets off!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.543
Pile them here!

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:28.500
- Come on.
- If there are bed sheets, use them too!

00:11:35.159 --> 00:11:37.180
Ma'am, I'm serious.

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:39.780
My kid had congenital heart disease, too.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.599
They said he wouldn't live past one year.

00:11:41.599 --> 00:11:44.780
A Sino-Thai joint team held a free clinic.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:47.310
He's healthy now. There are options!

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:49.059
Plenty of able hands here.

00:11:49.059 --> 00:11:51.900
Your arm's injured. No need to join in.

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:53.379
I'm fine.

00:11:53.379 --> 00:11:55.019
What's the matter?

00:11:55.019 --> 00:11:58.780
You don't feel as distant with me today.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:03.059
If we save the kid, dinner's on me tonight.

00:12:03.059 --> 00:12:07.860
Call it a celebration, and an apology for the accident.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:11.400
And if we don't?

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.200
Kidding.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:20.200
Looks like I'm getting a free meal either way.

00:12:22.459 --> 00:12:23.599
Oh no!

00:12:23.599 --> 00:12:25.880
Looks like rescue won't make it in time.

00:12:27.159 --> 00:12:32.300
They said don't catch the adult, only the child.

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:35.420
What if they both fall?

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.400
If that happens,

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:42.260
to avoid more injuries we can only...

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:44.179
Don't come closer! Stay back!

00:12:44.179 --> 00:12:45.660
Be careful!

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:09.580
Yes! We saved him!

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.290
Thank God!

00:13:46.579 --> 00:13:48.479
You Shu Lang!

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.359
You're crying.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:11.160
Don't you think death can also be a kind of release,
even redemption?

00:14:12.339 --> 00:14:14.440
Thank you.

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:17.855
What did you say?

00:14:17.855 --> 00:14:19.740
Redemption? What for?

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:23.019
Nothing. Just thinking about
what happened this afternoon.

00:14:25.946 --> 00:14:28.010
Here. Cheers to your heroic move.

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.550
And to you.

00:14:44.339 --> 00:14:47.250
Didn't expect you to be a matches-and-cigs guy.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.740
How's that brand?

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:54.440
Any good?

00:14:56.899 --> 00:14:59.105
Try it for yourself.

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:50.640
Well?

00:15:51.879 --> 00:15:53.420
Not my thing.

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:54.837
Too sweet.

00:15:54.837 --> 00:15:56.960
Kinda like...

00:15:58.919 --> 00:16:01.380
- Rouge.
- Rouge?

00:16:02.119 --> 00:16:03.919
Rouge.

00:16:04.659 --> 00:16:08.280
You really say what you think.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:12.520
Maybe today's just special.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:20.239
Sorry. I have to take this.

00:16:20.919 --> 00:16:22.679
I'll hit the restroom.

00:16:22.679 --> 00:16:24.279
You can stay put.

00:16:31.679 --> 00:16:33.047
Hello?

00:16:33.047 --> 00:16:35.319
Hey, Zhen Zhen.

00:16:35.319 --> 00:16:37.379
I'm eating out.

00:16:49.599 --> 00:16:51.480
Sounds fun!

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:52.764
Okay.

00:16:52.764 --> 00:16:55.256
I'll stay with you next weekend.

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:57.880
Miss you, too.

00:17:04.905 --> 00:17:07.040
Okay. You've got an early schedule.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.899
Sleep soon.

00:17:08.899 --> 00:17:10.379
Bye.

00:17:11.259 --> 00:17:12.680
Be good.

00:17:18.159 --> 00:17:21.698
You and your girlfriend
have a great relationship.

00:17:23.939 --> 00:17:27.120
I envy you, finding a soulmate.

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:29.310
Soulmate?

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:31.919
A bit much, isn't it?

00:17:31.919 --> 00:17:33.690
Do you love her?

00:17:35.939 --> 00:17:37.480
Yeah.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:38.950
I do.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:50.879
Guess I'm the loner at this table.

00:17:52.679 --> 00:17:54.419
It must be because you're too picky.

00:17:54.419 --> 00:17:56.919
That's part of it.

00:17:56.919 --> 00:17:59.480
So, what's your type, Mr. Fan?

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.591
Honestly?

00:18:03.591 --> 00:18:05.976
Your girlfriend seems great.

00:18:09.102 --> 00:18:11.140
Maybe I misspoke.

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:12.620
I grew up in Thailand.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.100
I'm not very fluent with Hua's language.

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.900
I always end up making a fool of myself.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:18.080
I mean...

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:20.536
she must be beautiful.

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:25.480
I trust your taste.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:28.360
If she has any sisters,

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:31.039
mind introducing them?

00:18:31.039 --> 00:18:33.339
Too bad.

00:18:35.919 --> 00:18:38.259
She doesn't.

00:18:39.899 --> 00:18:42.779
Thanks for dinner, Mr. You. See you.

00:18:42.779 --> 00:18:45.300
Take care, Mr. Fan.

00:19:04.699 --> 00:19:06.159
Boss.

00:19:14.459 --> 00:19:16.120
Huo.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:19.080
Find out who You Shu Lang's girlfriend is.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.980
I think I'm ready for a relationship.

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:22.443
Yes, sir.

00:19:23.479 --> 00:19:25.360
Zhen Zhen.

00:19:33.246 --> 00:19:34.819
Hey, Xiao Ya.

00:19:34.819 --> 00:19:36.820
Lu Zhen, did you get there?

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.239
Yeah.

00:19:38.239 --> 00:19:41.819
A tough-looking guy brought me in.

00:19:41.819 --> 00:19:43.620
He isn't great with Hua's language.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.295
He probably isn't from Hua Country.

00:19:45.295 --> 00:19:47.059
Oh?

00:19:47.059 --> 00:19:49.179
Then maybe the painter's from Hua Country.

00:19:49.179 --> 00:19:51.680
Our agency's been
in the Hua Country circle for years.

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:54.040
Most of our clients are Hua people.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.860
I'll check with business later.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:58.580
Don't worry, being a model
doesn't require Thai.

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:01.479
But you've barely been in Thailand and you've already landed a high-paying gig.

00:20:01.479 --> 00:20:04.000
They even asked for you. Take it seriously.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:06.020
Got it, ma'am.

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.780
I'll hang up first.

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:10.699
The room's empty,
so I'll touch up my makeup while I wait.

00:20:10.699 --> 00:20:12.179
Okay.

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:37.020
You're sure?

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:40.660
That's You Shu Lang's lover?

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:42.420
Yes.

00:20:44.358 --> 00:20:47.038
He looks so upright and untouchable.

00:20:47.038 --> 00:20:49.738
Who would've expected him to like men?

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:55.508
I guess nobody's perfect.

00:21:01.853 --> 00:21:06.977
I wonder if his lover smells like wild rose, too.

00:21:26.739 --> 00:21:28.544
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:21:28.544 --> 00:21:30.949
I had to take an important call.

00:21:30.949 --> 00:21:33.699
Sorry to waste your time, Mr. Lu.

00:21:33.699 --> 00:21:36.200
It's fine. It wasn't long.

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:37.886
- So, do I need to...
- I'm Fan Xiao.

00:21:37.886 --> 00:21:39.946
Forgot to introduce myself.

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.500
I'm Lu Zhen.

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:47.760
What do you need me to do?

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:51.019
Mr. Lu, just sit here and keep still.

00:21:51.019 --> 00:21:52.840
Okay.

00:21:55.759 --> 00:21:57.500
Do I need to change?

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:58.799
No.

00:21:58.799 --> 00:22:00.760
Your beauty is pure as is.

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:03.239
It doesn't need any embellishments.

00:22:03.239 --> 00:22:07.259
Hope that doesn't offend you.

00:22:08.179 --> 00:22:11.605
Just call me Lu Zhen. Everyone does.

00:22:11.605 --> 00:22:13.283
Everyone?

00:22:13.283 --> 00:22:17.300
Your lover, too?

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:21.940
No offense.

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:25.162
I just like to build trust with my subjects.

00:22:25.162 --> 00:22:28.339
Intimacy, even.

00:22:28.339 --> 00:22:30.080
Like...

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:32.360
lovers.

00:22:34.880 --> 00:22:36.200
Don't worry.

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:38.560
No physical contact.

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:41.399
I hope you understand what I mean.

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:45.760
I've fallen in love with a flower
in my studio before.

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:47.520
With a cloud.

00:22:47.520 --> 00:22:51.299
I'll probably fall for you a little
while we work.

00:22:52.160 --> 00:22:57.920
I hope you don't mind my love, a man's love.

00:22:59.539 --> 00:23:01.959
I get it.

00:23:01.959 --> 00:23:05.680
I just don't know what I'm supposed to do.

00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:07.160
Just sit still.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:12.439
And tell me, what does your lover call you?

00:23:13.679 --> 00:23:16.479
What makes you so sure I have one?

00:23:16.479 --> 00:23:18.040
Gut feeling.

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.639
So...

00:23:19.639 --> 00:23:21.959
I'm right?

00:23:21.959 --> 00:23:23.960
What does he call you?

00:23:26.359 --> 00:23:28.140
Zhen Zhen.

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:29.937
Zhen Zhen.

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:33.420
Okay, Zhen Zhen.

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:38.200
Sit up straight and look ahead.

00:23:38.944 --> 00:23:40.358
Okay.

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:47.940
Xiao, these were pre-screened by the team.

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:52.983
They fit Pinfeng Capital's direction, and have market potential.

00:23:52.983 --> 00:23:54.440
Take a look.

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:59.160
If they're acceptable, I'll have the team draft term sheets

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:00.920
and start due diligence.

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:03.040
It's a mountain of paperwork.

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:07.120
If you don't want to read it all, just sign.

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:08.620
Vice President Xu.

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:11.359
Let's use titles at work,

00:24:11.359 --> 00:24:15.239
Don't confuse the staff.

00:24:15.959 --> 00:24:18.199
Fine, we'll do it your way, Xiao...

00:24:18.199 --> 00:24:21.119
No, President Fan.

00:24:21.119 --> 00:24:24.620
President Fan, how are these files?

00:24:25.359 --> 00:24:27.859
Who's Head of Admin?

00:24:28.800 --> 00:24:30.599
That's me, Xu Gang.

00:24:30.599 --> 00:24:35.159
We focus on Hua Country's companies and Hua Country's market.

00:24:35.159 --> 00:24:39.439
Most of our people are Hua people
or Thai-Hua.

00:24:39.439 --> 00:24:42.959
So, our protocols should
align with Hua Country.

00:24:42.959 --> 00:24:44.760
Tell me.

00:24:44.760 --> 00:24:48.359
At a department-head meeting in Hua Country,

00:24:48.359 --> 00:24:52.080
is this how the seats are arranged?

00:24:53.459 --> 00:24:55.959
That's how company meetings
have always been arranged.

00:24:55.959 --> 00:24:57.940
Always been.

00:24:58.520 --> 00:24:59.959
Right.

00:24:59.959 --> 00:25:03.520
It's my first official meeting here.

00:25:03.520 --> 00:25:07.400
So, perhaps you didn't get a chance
to adjust my seat.

00:25:07.400 --> 00:25:09.520
My mistake, sorry about that.

00:25:09.520 --> 00:25:11.400
It's no big deal.

00:25:11.400 --> 00:25:13.160
I'm formally taking over.

00:25:13.160 --> 00:25:17.479
There are lots to learn.

00:25:17.479 --> 00:25:19.439
You'll need time to adjust, too.

00:25:19.439 --> 00:25:20.959
Have a seat.

00:25:23.880 --> 00:25:28.079
Vice President Xu,
I'll go through these carefully.

00:25:28.079 --> 00:25:33.619
Can't have you working so hard at your age.

00:25:35.680 --> 00:25:37.760
Let's wrap up for today.

00:25:37.760 --> 00:25:39.920
The background checks have been tough.

00:25:39.920 --> 00:25:42.479
Tonight, dinner's on me. We'll relax a little.

00:25:42.479 --> 00:25:45.319
You pick the place, and I'll pay.

00:25:45.319 --> 00:25:47.840
Thank you, President Fan!

00:25:50.460 --> 00:25:52.719
One more thing.

00:25:52.719 --> 00:25:56.079
Have the Investment Director
send all project materials to my office,

00:25:56.079 --> 00:25:59.839
including the ones that didn't make the cut.

00:26:22.280 --> 00:26:26.619
Boss, here are the details on the sponsor
paying

00:26:26.619 --> 00:26:27.940
for the CFO's son's studies abroad.

00:26:27.940 --> 00:26:29.420
It's Mr. Xu's nephew.

00:26:29.420 --> 00:26:31.119
Also, admin's Xu Gang.

00:26:31.119 --> 00:26:34.780
The company procurement ledgers
are in your inbox.

00:26:34.780 --> 00:26:36.920
Things never change.

00:26:36.920 --> 00:26:39.000
Here are the project proposals
from the Investment Director.

00:26:39.000 --> 00:26:41.280
The tall stack contains the rejected ones.

00:26:41.280 --> 00:26:43.200
I'll head out.

00:26:50.501 --> 00:26:51.980
[Functional Probiotic Strain
Pharmaceutical Project Investment Proposal]

00:26:54.227 --> 00:26:55.980
Bohai Pharma?

00:26:55.980 --> 00:26:57.880
Bohai.

00:27:02.760 --> 00:27:04.939
Bohai Pharma.

00:27:04.939 --> 00:27:06.740
You Shu Lang.

00:27:08.959 --> 00:27:13.650
Looks like fate won't stop
throwing us together.

00:27:18.839 --> 00:27:20.580
Fan Xiao?

00:27:21.359 --> 00:27:23.820
Why would he call me?

00:27:27.280 --> 00:27:28.640
Hello?

00:27:28.640 --> 00:27:31.660
Hello, Mr. You.

00:27:33.219 --> 00:27:34.860
Hello, Mr. Fan.

00:27:34.860 --> 00:27:36.920
What made you call?

00:27:36.920 --> 00:27:38.359
I'm lost.

00:27:38.359 --> 00:27:40.060
What do I do?

00:27:41.419 --> 00:27:47.299
I recall you haven't pointed me
in the right direction since the hospital.

00:27:57.299 --> 00:27:59.140
How'd you manage to strand yourself out here?

00:27:59.140 --> 00:28:00.680
No idea.

00:28:00.680 --> 00:28:05.400
I followed the GPS and hit a dead end.

00:28:05.400 --> 00:28:09.400
I circled around, and somehow ended up here.

00:28:09.400 --> 00:28:13.079
You got lost coming
from the airport last time too?

00:28:13.079 --> 00:28:15.755
Yeah. I've got a terrible sense of direction.

00:28:15.755 --> 00:28:17.439
I'm always getting lost.

00:28:17.439 --> 00:28:19.839
Bangkok's road system is a maze.

00:28:19.839 --> 00:28:21.520
Not like Hua Country.

00:28:21.520 --> 00:28:24.120
Honestly, sometimes...

00:28:24.120 --> 00:28:26.780
getting lost can be fun.

00:28:26.780 --> 00:28:29.880
You see things you'd usually miss.

00:28:29.880 --> 00:28:32.660
Look. There's a bird's nest.

00:28:32.660 --> 00:28:34.380
While I was waiting for you,

00:28:34.380 --> 00:28:37.520
I saw a downy chick
that hadn't fully feathered

00:28:37.520 --> 00:28:40.100
fall out of its nest.

00:28:40.100 --> 00:28:43.739
Do you think it slipped?

00:28:45.620 --> 00:28:48.540
Ever hear what biologists say?

00:28:49.500 --> 00:28:51.500
What do they say?

00:28:51.500 --> 00:28:54.219
They say...

00:28:54.219 --> 00:28:58.959
when a chick gets shoved out of the nest, nine times out of ten,

00:28:58.959 --> 00:29:02.959
it's from siblings fighting for food and pushing it out.

00:29:02.959 --> 00:29:03.939
Don't call me "big brother"!

00:29:03.939 --> 00:29:06.100
Fan Xiao, you're just like your mother.

00:29:06.100 --> 00:29:07.900
Illegitimate child

00:29:08.640 --> 00:29:12.959
Sometimes, the parents favor the others.

00:29:12.959 --> 00:29:15.699
They don't want to waste
hard-won food on the weak one.

00:29:15.699 --> 00:29:16.699
I told you before,

00:29:16.699 --> 00:29:18.419
you should learn from your older brother.

00:29:18.419 --> 00:29:21.019
instead of just fooling around every day.

00:29:23.640 --> 00:29:27.920
Our family runs on seniority.

00:29:27.920 --> 00:29:31.039
You're the child of a concubine.

00:29:31.039 --> 00:29:34.779
You don't get a say here.

00:29:42.839 --> 00:29:45.100
So, which is it?

00:29:47.299 --> 00:29:48.479
Let's head back.

00:29:48.479 --> 00:29:50.199
It's getting late.

00:29:50.199 --> 00:29:52.660
You're not going to save it?

00:29:52.660 --> 00:29:55.500
The chick might not be dead yet.

00:29:59.520 --> 00:30:00.740
Save it? How?

00:30:00.740 --> 00:30:03.459
Put it back?

00:30:03.459 --> 00:30:06.480
How do you know it won't
just get shoved out again?

00:30:08.179 --> 00:30:12.640
You know putting it back

00:30:12.640 --> 00:30:14.820
won't save it.

00:30:15.620 --> 00:30:18.939
So, why did you save that baby?

00:30:18.939 --> 00:30:21.059
Do you think saving it

00:30:21.059 --> 00:30:23.620
will stop his illness from torturing him?

00:30:23.620 --> 00:30:25.620
Do you think he would live on?

00:30:26.479 --> 00:30:28.520
I just gave life a chance.

00:30:28.520 --> 00:30:32.040
And I was right there.

00:30:32.040 --> 00:30:35.459
I couldn't just stand and watch.

00:30:36.339 --> 00:30:39.144
But nature has its rules.

00:30:39.144 --> 00:30:41.744
We shouldn't meddle too much.

00:30:42.520 --> 00:30:45.299
It's a little awkward to say,

00:30:45.299 --> 00:30:49.020
but I want to let you know.

00:30:49.020 --> 00:30:51.000
My company has covered
the child's medical expenses.

00:30:51.000 --> 00:30:53.519
He'll get to grow up healthily.

00:30:55.459 --> 00:30:57.060
So...

00:30:57.740 --> 00:31:01.260
Thank you for your quick action and courage.

00:31:01.260 --> 00:31:04.080
You bought him that chance.

00:31:06.959 --> 00:31:08.660
I...

00:31:13.160 --> 00:31:15.260
It's late.

00:31:15.260 --> 00:31:17.020
Let's go.

00:31:17.020 --> 00:31:18.059
I'm starving.

00:31:18.059 --> 00:31:21.699
Let me buy you dinner to say thanks.

00:31:21.699 --> 00:31:23.680
I've still got work tonight.

00:31:23.680 --> 00:31:24.939
Maybe next time.

00:31:24.939 --> 00:31:26.380
Work?

00:31:26.380 --> 00:31:29.319
As in pushing the new financing?

00:31:29.319 --> 00:31:31.179
How'd you know?

00:31:31.179 --> 00:31:35.339
A few VC decks landed on my desk.

00:31:35.339 --> 00:31:38.260
Your company's in the pile.

00:31:38.260 --> 00:31:40.740
We're prepping to talk.

00:31:41.780 --> 00:31:43.020
Let's not stand here.

00:31:43.020 --> 00:31:45.699
Come on, we can eat and talk.

00:31:45.699 --> 00:31:47.439
I know a good spot.

00:31:47.439 --> 00:31:48.579
Perfect.

00:31:48.579 --> 00:31:50.219
Lead the way.

00:32:07.620 --> 00:32:13.860
Today, Bohai Pharma's meeting
with Pinfeng Capital went great.

00:32:13.860 --> 00:32:17.020
We've further aligned our goals,

00:32:17.020 --> 00:32:19.539
President Fan, anything else you need.

00:32:19.539 --> 00:32:21.260
Any guidance?

00:32:21.260 --> 00:32:25.740
Director Liu, your materials are thorough.

00:32:25.740 --> 00:32:29.819
But our current round has a clear target.

00:32:29.819 --> 00:32:33.219
It's for products targeting
Hua Country's domestic market.

00:32:33.219 --> 00:32:36.500
That's why we're looking at

00:32:36.500 --> 00:32:38.260
Bohai Pharma from Hua Country.

00:32:38.260 --> 00:32:41.459
So, we'll need more targeted data.

00:32:41.459 --> 00:32:42.620
No rush.

00:32:42.620 --> 00:32:45.979
Shu Lang and I can speak anytime.

00:32:51.620 --> 00:32:53.380
What a surprise!

00:32:53.380 --> 00:32:56.819
So, you're acquainted with Director You?

00:32:56.819 --> 00:32:59.739
This is truly a stroke of fate
for our companies!

00:33:01.260 --> 00:33:03.179
Didn't they say President Fan grew up abroad

00:33:03.179 --> 00:33:04.860
and only recently came back to Thailand?

00:33:04.860 --> 00:33:05.860
How are they so close?

00:33:05.860 --> 00:33:09.140
No idea. Maybe they knew each other before.

00:33:09.140 --> 00:33:11.699
Even at the welcome line earlier,

00:33:11.699 --> 00:33:13.419
he kept calling him "Shu Lang".

00:33:13.419 --> 00:33:15.379
Doesn't sound like they just met.

00:33:16.699 --> 00:33:20.059
Director, the banquet's about ready.

00:33:20.059 --> 00:33:21.699
Shall we move to the restaurant?

00:33:21.699 --> 00:33:22.780
Perfect.

00:33:22.780 --> 00:33:26.780
President Fan, we brought
our own chef team from home.

00:33:26.780 --> 00:33:29.020
You can taste the most authentic

00:33:29.020 --> 00:33:31.939
Hua Country dishes and good liquor.

00:33:31.939 --> 00:33:34.140
Then I'll happily accept.

00:33:34.140 --> 00:33:37.179
I can hold my liquor.

00:33:37.179 --> 00:33:39.460
Shu Lang knows that best.

00:33:40.980 --> 00:33:43.299
Then I'll have Xiao You

00:33:43.299 --> 00:33:45.300
keep you company for a few more drinks.

00:33:46.219 --> 00:33:47.820
Okay.

00:33:50.740 --> 00:33:53.700
President Fan is a lifesaver!

00:33:53.700 --> 00:33:55.611
Come, President Fan. Cheers!

00:33:55.611 --> 00:33:57.380
Open another bottle.

00:33:57.380 --> 00:34:00.939
Xiao Ding, why am I seated
next to the main seat?

00:34:00.939 --> 00:34:03.900
Shouldn't that be for
Director Liu and the deputies?

00:34:03.900 --> 00:34:05.419
There's been no mistake.

00:34:05.419 --> 00:34:07.699
Director Liu told me

00:34:07.699 --> 00:34:09.539
to put you next to President Fan.

00:34:09.539 --> 00:34:11.739
I thought you knew.

00:34:11.739 --> 00:34:14.660
- President Fan, enjoy.
- Go on.

00:34:14.660 --> 00:34:15.900
We at Bohai Pharma

00:34:15.900 --> 00:34:18.420
have just finished
our state-owned restructuring.

00:34:18.420 --> 00:34:22.019
We have a stack of drug approvals.

00:34:22.019 --> 00:34:23.739
But without capital,

00:34:23.739 --> 00:34:26.940
approvals don't turn into cash.

00:34:27.860 --> 00:34:30.900
Everyone here is an industry professional,

00:34:30.900 --> 00:34:33.180
so I won't preach.

00:34:33.180 --> 00:34:35.900
But if we're targeting Hua Country's market,

00:34:35.900 --> 00:34:38.563
I have to talk specifics.

00:34:39.779 --> 00:34:45.779
You all know how well Kun Pharm's
Anxin Oral Liquid does yearly.

00:34:45.779 --> 00:34:49.259
And that's not counting the halo on other SKUs.

00:34:49.259 --> 00:34:52.460
Director Liu, Shuxin Oral Liquid

00:34:52.460 --> 00:34:54.499
never even went into production.

00:34:54.499 --> 00:34:59.940
Frankly, that's begging
while holding a gold rice bowl.

00:35:02.779 --> 00:35:08.019
President Fan, if you like that OTC direction,

00:35:08.019 --> 00:35:11.660
we'll redo a new plan

00:35:11.660 --> 00:35:13.660
and show you.

00:35:13.660 --> 00:35:15.100
Xiao You, come on.

00:35:15.100 --> 00:35:17.379
Fill President Fan's glass.

00:35:23.245 --> 00:35:26.151
Usually I'm the one pouring for Director You.

00:35:26.151 --> 00:35:28.660
How dare I trouble him tonight?

00:35:28.660 --> 00:35:30.059
President Fan.

00:35:30.660 --> 00:35:37.020
This partnership between Pinfeng
and Bohai is riding on Director You.

00:35:37.020 --> 00:35:41.499
I say this project be led by Director You.

00:35:41.499 --> 00:35:43.340
He's got a medical background.

00:35:43.340 --> 00:35:47.820
It's a waste to keep him as an office director.

00:35:47.820 --> 00:35:51.059
Director, please... Don't flatter me.

00:35:51.059 --> 00:35:52.179
I'm not that capable.

00:35:52.179 --> 00:35:56.083
How will you know if you don't try?

00:36:02.739 --> 00:36:04.179
As for the investment,

00:36:04.179 --> 00:36:06.939
please favor Bohai.

00:36:06.939 --> 00:36:08.486
Well, no problem.

00:36:12.340 --> 00:36:16.140
Come. Let's raise a glass to President Fan!

00:36:16.140 --> 00:36:18.819
Here's to a great partnership!

00:36:37.526 --> 00:36:40.990
Your company was lining up to toast,

00:36:40.990 --> 00:36:44.030
but you ducked in here
for some peace and quiet?

00:37:09.678 --> 00:37:13.030
You don't need a foot soldier like me.

00:37:28.720 --> 00:37:30.785
You've had a few.

00:37:30.785 --> 00:37:32.585
Watch your step.

00:37:33.372 --> 00:37:35.613
Trash can's on your side;

00:37:36.672 --> 00:37:38.272
I'll toss this.

00:37:39.033 --> 00:37:43.441
Mad about what I said at the table just now?

00:37:43.441 --> 00:37:45.466
No.

00:37:45.466 --> 00:37:48.292
You were boosting my value.

00:37:48.292 --> 00:37:49.637
Why would I be mad?

00:37:49.637 --> 00:37:52.388
If we're investing anyway,

00:37:52.388 --> 00:37:56.419
why not put you on a pedestal?

00:37:56.419 --> 00:37:58.059
You're really investing?

00:37:58.059 --> 00:38:00.641
The project's got legs.

00:38:00.641 --> 00:38:02.587
So...

00:38:02.587 --> 00:38:03.900
So...

00:38:03.900 --> 00:38:05.739
When we go back out,

00:38:05.739 --> 00:38:08.780
Grand Director You should play
a little hard-to-get.

00:38:08.780 --> 00:38:11.700
Make those clueless folks

00:38:12.673 --> 00:38:18.273
all shut their mouths.